OL,4,CColombian police storm supermarket to  
OL,5,Cfree 20 held hostage for 17 hours      
OL,6,GColombian security forces have freed   
OL,7,Garound 20 shoppers and employees who   
OL,8,Ghad been held hostage for about 17     
OL,9,Ghours at a supermarket in the city of  
OL,10,GCartagena.                             
OL,12,FGunmen had stormed into the building   
OL,13,Fat 08:00 (13:00 GMT) on Tuesday after  
OL,14,Fwhat Colombian President Abelardo de   
OL,15,Fla Espriella said was a failed attempt 
OL,16,Fat robbing an armoured car carrying    
OL,17,Fmoney.                                 
OL,19,FThey held those inside at gunpoint     
OL,20,Fwhile trying to negotiate their        
OL,21,Fgetaway.                               
